- 7 sections (diamond, edge-attributes, edge-styles, isolated-node, parallel-edges, self-loop, simple-chain), each with: input snippet, CLI ASCII render (byte-verified against `examples/<name>/expected.txt` — I programmatically checked all 7 blocks match exactly), and `![](gallery/<name>.svg)`
