**Generator** — `crates/gently-core/examples/gallery.rs`: standalone cargo example (not a CLI flag, per the gently-4ig boundary); reads `input.gv`, `text::parse`, prints `graphviz::render(&graph)` DOT to stdout. No layout (dot lays out its own graph). Notes it may be retired once `gently --as dot` lands.

